 "about_text": "Albertz benda is a contemporary art gallery founded in 2015, with its flagship space in Chelsea, New York, and a second location that opened in Los Angeles in 2021, presented within a domestic setting. The gallery's program centers on solo exhibitions of emerging and mid-career artists alongside thematic group shows, bringing together a global roster whose work engages cultural and social dialogues and questions of materiality across generations and disciplines. Albertz benda also undertakes historical research projects, revisiting the full careers of overlooked or historic figures and situating them within contemporary contexts. The gallery has supported institutional projects and acquisitions, with works by its artists held in numerous public collections worldwide.",
